 nt?event=82324\nhttps://bit.ly/4imvhfe\n\nDescription:\nHey\, undergrads! 
 Start the fall term off by mentoring each other.❤️ Grab two friends (o
 r make some) and rotate through a speed-mentoring round in trios—one ask
 s\, one answers\, one observes—then swap until you’ve been in every se
 at. Prompt cards guide each round and are matched to your year: explore wh
 at’s out there\, or sharpen your internship-and-job search. Career & Lif
 e Design Coaches will be available\, and snacks will also be provided! Dro
 p by whenever and stay as long as you like.\nRegister\nin Handshake\n!\n\n
 Sponsor / organizer: Dartmouth Center for Career Design\n\nAudience: Stude
 nts-Undergraduate\n\nSource: Dartmouth\n\nWhy this was included: food keyw
